"자세한 정보는 최신 :ref:`supported_distributions`을 참조하십시오. 특정 "
"버전에 대한 정보는 ` (ROCm 7.2.2/7.2.1), <https://rocm.docs.amd.com/projects/"
"install-on-linux/en/docs-7.2.2/reference/system-requirements.html#supported-"
"operating-systems> (` __), ` (ROCm 7.1.0) 및 <https://rocm.docs.amd.com/"
"projects/install-on-linux/en/docs-7.1.0/reference/system-"
