msgid "Support overview"
msgstr "지원 개요"

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:26
msgid ""
"The ROCm-supported version of DGL is maintained in the official "
"`https://github.com/ROCm/dgl <https://github.com/ROCm/dgl>`__ repository,"
" which differs from the `https://github.com/dmlc/dgl "
"<https://github.com/dmlc/dgl>`__ upstream repository."
msgstr ""
"ROCm이 지원하는 DGL 버전은 공식 ` https://github.com/ROCm/dgl <https://"
"github.com/ROCm/dgl> ` __ 저장소에서 관리되며, 이는 ` https://github.com/"
"dmlc/dgl <https://github.com/dmlc/dgl> ` __ 업스트림 저장소와 다릅니다."

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:30
msgid ""
"To get started and install DGL on ROCm, use the prebuilt :ref:`Docker "
"images <dgl-docker-compat>`, which include ROCm, DGL, and all required "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""
"ROCm에 DGL을 설치하여 시작하려면, ROCm, DGL 및 필요한 모든 종속성이 포함된 "
"사전 빌드된 ‘:ref:`’ Docker 이미지( <dgl-docker-compat>`)를 사용하십시오."

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:33
msgid ""
"See the :doc:`ROCm DGL installation guide <rocm-install-on-linux:install"
"/3rd-party/dgl-install>` for installation and setup instructions."
msgstr ""
"설치 및 설정 방법은 ‘:doc:` ROCm DGL 설치 가이드’( <rocm-install-on-"
"linux:install/3rd-party/dgl-install>`)를 참조하십시오."

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:36
msgid ""
"You can also consult the upstream `Installation guide "
"<https://www.dgl.ai/pages/start.html>`__ for additional context."
msgstr ""
"추가적인 정보를 확인하려면 업스트림 ` 설치 가이드 <https://www.dgl.ai/pages/"
"start.html> ` __를 참고할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/dgl-compatibility.rst:48
msgid ""
"AMD validates and publishes `DGL images "
"<https://hub.docker.com/r/rocm/dgl/tags>`__ with ROCm backends on Docker "
"Hub. The following Docker image tags and associated inventories represent"
" the latest available DGL version from the official Docker Hub. Click the"
" |docker-icon| to view the image on Docker Hub."
msgstr ""
"AMD는 Docker Hub에서 ROCm 백엔드가 포함된 ` DGL 이미지 <https://"
"hub.docker.com/r/rocm/dgl/tags> ` __를 검증하고 공개합니다. 다음 Docker "
"이미지 태그 및 관련 인벤토리는 공식 Docker Hub에서 제공되는 최신 DGL 버전을 "
"나타냅니다. |docker-icon|를 클릭하면 Docker Hub에서 해당 이미지를 확인할 수 "
"있습니다."

