#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/jax-compatibility.rst:13
msgid ""
"`JAX <https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/notebooks/thinking_in_jax.html>`__ "
"is a library for array-oriented numerical computation (similar to NumPy),"
" with automatic differentiation and just-in-time (JIT) compilation to "
"enable high-performance machine learning research."
msgstr ""
"` JAX <https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/notebooks/thinking_in_jax.html> ` __는 "
"배열 기반 수치 계산(NumPy와 유사)을 위한 라이브러리로, 자동 미분 및 JIT(Just-"
"in-Time) 컴파일 기능을 통해 고성능 머신러닝 연구를 가능하게 합니다."

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/jax-compatibility.rst:17
msgid ""
"JAX provides an API that combines automatic differentiation and the "
"Accelerated Linear Algebra (XLA) compiler to achieve high-performance "
"machine learning at scale. JAX uses composable transformations of Python "
"and NumPy through JIT compilation, automatic vectorization, and "
"parallelization."
msgstr ""
"JAX는 자동 미분과 가속 선형 대수(XLA) 컴파일러를 결합한 API를 제공하여 "
"대규모 환경에서 고성능 머신러닝을 구현합니다. JAX는 JIT 컴파일, 자동 벡터화 "
"및 병렬화를 통해 Python과 NumPy의 변환 연산을 조합하여 활용합니다."

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/jax-compatibility.rst:25
msgid ""
"The ROCm-supported version of JAX is maintained in the official "
"`https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-jax <https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-jax>`__ "
"repository, which differs from the `https://github.com/jax-ml/jax "
"<https://github.com/jax-ml/jax>`__ upstream repository."
msgstr ""
"ROCm이 지원하는 JAX 버전은 공식 ` https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-jax <https://"
"github.com/ROCm/rocm-jax> ` __ 저장소에서 관리되며, 이는 ` https://"
"github.com/jax-ml/jax <https://github.com/jax-ml/jax> ` __ 업스트림 저장소와 "
"다릅니다."

