"이미지들은 AMD의 철저한 테스트를 거칩니다."

#: ../../compatibility/ml-compatibility/pytorch-compatibility.rst:60
msgid ""
":doc:`Using ROCm for AI: training a model </how-to/rocm-for-ai/training"
