"with a single GPU. This topic provides a detailed guide for setting up, "
"optimizing, and executing fine-tuning and inference workflows in such "
"environments."
msgstr ""
":doc:` ‘단일 GPU를 활용한 미세 조정 및 추론’ </how-to/rocm-for-ai/fine-"
